{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001784535","cik":"0001784535","slug":"porch-group-784535","name":"Porch Group, Inc.","ticker":"PRCH","exchanges":["Nasdaq"],"sector":"Services-Prepackaged Software","sic":"7372","country":"WA","website":"","listed_years":6.4,"first_annual":"2020-03-20","last_filing":"2026-07-30","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001784535&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["Porch Group, Inc. files with the SEC under \"Services-Prepackaged Software\", based in WA, and has been publicly reporting for 6 years.","It reported $463.3m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 23.2% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 66.4%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 70 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 23.2% year on year (Q2 2026 vs Q2 2025), reaching $131.8m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1784535/000178453526000048/0001784535-26-000048-index.htm","accession":"0001784535-26-000048"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in 6 of the last 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1784535/000178453526000048/0001784535-26-000048-index.htm","accession":"0001784535-26-000048"},{"text":"Gross margin of 66.4% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1784535/000178453526000048/0001784535-26-000048-index.htm","accession":"0001784535-26-000048"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-8.3% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1784535/000178453526000048/0001784535-26-000048-index.htm","accession":"0001784535-26-000048"}],"bear":[{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 77.2% to 66.4% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising or the company is discounting to hold volume.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1784535/000178453526000048/0001784535-26-000048-index.htm","accession":"0001784535-26-000048"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-3.1% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1784535/000178453526000048/0001784535-26-000048-index.htm","accession":"0001784535-26-000048"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $9.2m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1784535/000178453526000048/0001784535-26-000048-index.htm","accession":"0001784535-26-000048"},{"text":"Shareholders' equity is negative (-$11.8m) - liabilities exceed assets on the balance sheet.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1784535/000178453526000048/0001784535-26-000048-index.htm","accession":"0001784535-26-000048"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 58.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.58,"consecutive":2,"current":0.664,"current_display":"66.4%","threshold_display":"58.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive quarters stops one bad quarter from forcing a sale.","editable":true},{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric"